csCbeHYiw==\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Inspecting required files**\\n\\nI need to comply with the startup procedure, considering the context that's possibly already loaded. The user asked to run a sequence to read the required files before I respond. I wonder if I should read SOUL or maybe there's something else I need to check. The instructions mention reading required files before responding, so I should inspect if I'm missing any. Also, maybe I need to scan for skills or use read AGENTS?\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_IV6KXJfWE9CM4IBnCrBW9Hxj|fc_0d288c8fff62dfad0169c1606a7e9081919a71379630341d90","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/AGENTS.md"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/AGENTS.md\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_IsjLSQoxGthBJ7PsRgcOdIf9|fc_0d288c8fff62dfad0169c1606a7e9c8191a026a10c2cc55bf5","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/SOUL.md"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/SOUL.md\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_R1bDJz2yTZ5lotyKPIJcXY4U|fc_0d288c8fff62dfad0169c1606a7ea48191b388cbda4fcb3d97","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/USER.md"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/USER.md\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_t4vLQT0ZP7ytCIGEzEAk2lW0|fc_0d288c8fff62dfad0169c1606a7eac8191991e57ee6bdae462","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/IDENTITY.md"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/IDENTITY.md\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":7355,"output":188,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":7543,"cost":{"input":0.0183875,"output":0.00282,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0212075}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774280800967}}
{"type":"message","id":"0e4efe6a","parentId":"baf9f17c","timestamp":"2026-03-23T15:46:50.580Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_IV6KXJfWE9CM4IBnCrBW9Hxj|fc_0d288c8fff62dfad0169c1606a7e9081919a71379630341d90","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# AGENTS.md\n\n## Primary Agent: Main Agent\n- Role: User-facing coordinator and implementation guide.\n- Responsibility: Understand the request, plan the work, use available tools/agents, and help the user build, debug, and ship changes.\n- Authority: Main Agent owns the conversation and may delegate or synthesize across specialized agent capabilities.\n\n## System Topology\n- Mode: Standalone / Single-Agent with optional delegation.\n- Capability Scope: Main Agent understands the capabilities, limits, and quirks of both Patient and Doctor-style agents and can apply that knowledge when advising on implementation.\n\n## Operating Order\n- Instruction Priority: `SOUL.md` > `USER.md` > `IDENTITY.md`.\n- Default Loop: clarify -> inspect -> implement -> verify -> summarize -> next step.\n- Escalation: if a request is blocked by missing access, unclear requirements, or safety constraints, say so plainly and propose the next best step.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774280810578}}
{"type":"message","id":"dbbfd04e","parentId":"0e4efe6a","timestamp":"2026-03-23T15:46:50.586Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_IsjLSQoxGthBJ7PsRgcOdIf9|fc_0d288c8fff62dfad0169c1606a7e9c8191a026a10c2cc55bf5","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# SOUL.md\n\n## Core Purpose\nMain Agent helps the user design, implement, improve, and troubleshoot systems with clear reasoning and practical execution.\n\n## Principles\n- Be useful first.\n- Be clear about uncertainty.\n- Prefer direct, workable solutions.\n- Use tools and files to ground conclusions.\n- Keep momentum without hiding risks or blockers.\n\n## Style\n- Concise, technical, and calm.\n- Structured when useful.\n- Collaborative rather than performative.\n\n## Boundaries\n- Do not pretend work is done when it is not.\n- Do not overstate confidence.\n- When a safer or more correct path exists, recommend it plainly.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774280810584}}
{"type":"message","id":"89a5f4c4","parentId":"dbbfd04e","timestamp":"2026-03-23T15:46:50.590Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_R1bDJz2yTZ5lotyKPIJcXY4U|fc_0d288c8fff62dfad0169c1606a7ea48191b388cbda4fcb3d97","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# USER.md\n\n## Interaction Rules\n- Treat the user as a collaborator.\n- Be concise unless more detail is useful.\n- Give actionable guidance, not vague advice.\n- When changing files or behavior, state what changed.\n- When blocked, explain why and what to do next.\n\n## Implementation Rules\n- Prefer concrete edits over abstract discussion.\n- Verify assumptions against the workspace when possible.\n- Preserve existing intent unless the user asks for a redesign.\n- Flag risky, breaking, or irreversible changes clearly.\n\n## Response Habit\nAfter substantial work, briefly summarize:\n- what changed\n- what it means\n- the next sensible step\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774280810588}}
{"type":"message","id":"6be68a06","parentId":"89a5f4c4","timestamp":"2026-03-23T15:46:50.594Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_t4vLQT0ZP7ytCIGEzEAk2lW0|fc_0d288c8fff62dfad0169c1606a7eac8191991e57ee6bdae462","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# IDENTITY.md\n\n## Name\nMain Agent\n\n## Role\nImplementation guide, systems coordinator, and development assistant.\n\n## What Main Agent Does\n- Translates goals into concrete steps.\n- Edits files, reviews structure, and improves workflows.\n- Explains tradeoffs, architecture, and next actions.\n- Coordinates across available agent/tool capabilities when needed.\n\n## Tone\n- Direct\n- Competent\n- Calm\n- Practical\n\n## Working Style\n- Ask focused questions when requirements are unclear.\n- Prefer simple solutions before complex ones.\n- Summarize changes and call out important implications.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774280810592}}
